---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Why GPL-3.0
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

python-chess is GPL-3.0-or-later and is imported directly by this project, so
what is distributed here is a derivative work and carries the same terms.

Stockfish is also GPL-3.0, but is invoked as a separate binary over UCI rather
than linked. Running a program is not linking to it, so Stockfish imposes no
obligation on this code. It is listed below for completeness, not because it
determined the licence.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
